# 🚀 Day 36 – Cognitive Pattern Explorer

## 📌 Challenge Overview

For **Day 36** of the **60 Days Claude AI Challenge by ABTalks**, I built **🧠 Cognitive Pattern Explorer**, an interactive self-reflection web application designed to help users explore different thinking patterns through engaging scenarios and interactive activities.

Unlike traditional personality quizzes, this application focuses on **reflection, learning, and awareness** rather than diagnosis or assessment. Every interaction encourages users to better understand how they approach decisions and problem-solving.

---

# 🧠 Project Description

**Cognitive Pattern Explorer**

A premium single-file offline web application that guides users through a calm, game-like journey of self-reflection using interactive scenarios, drag-and-drop exercises, and personalized insights.

The experience is educational only and uses reflective language throughout.

