# 🎯 User Journey

## 🌿 Step 1 – Choose Your Mode

Select your experience:

- 🌱 Calm Mode
- ⚡ Stress Mode

Each mode provides a different reflective experience while maintaining an educational focus.

---

## 🧩 Chapter 1 – Discover Your Thinking Style

Explore realistic situations and choose responses that best reflect your natural thinking approach.

Learn how different thinking styles influence everyday decisions.

---

## 🎯 Chapter 2 – Choose Your Priorities

Use drag-and-drop cards to organize what matters most when making decisions.

This activity encourages users to reflect on their personal values and priorities.

---

## 🗺 Chapter 3 – Map Your Thinking

Arrange events on an interactive timeline to visualize how your thoughts typically flow during decision-making.

The exercise highlights patterns rather than providing fixed labels.

---

## 📖 Final Reflection Journal

Receive a personalized reflection including:

- Thinking Pattern Breakdown
- Percentage Distribution
- Personalized Insights
- Growth Opportunities
- Reflection Notes

